* 
* Rap command file
* For barge aft part
*
new/append model 
filename ./src/barge.igs
all mappings
read file
heal model
HEAL:plot grid lines on boundaries (3D) toggle 1
set view:0 -0.00927536 0.008657 0 2.67746 0.642788 0.383022 0.663414 0 0.866025 -0.5 -0.766044 0.321394 0.55667
#pause
close
*
* Build the connectivity and a global triangulation
*
topology
merge tolerance 0.02
maximum area 0.15
split tolerance factor 2
deltaS 0.15
build edge curves 
merge edge curves    
* the connectivity is determined
#pause
*
* triangulate
*
triangulate
* global triangulation
#pause
exit
*
* Save the  hull
*
save model
barge_rapped.hdf
* model has been saved
exit
